1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,510
Mistaking a dog breed

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:02,861
with AI is harmless,

3
00:00:02,861 --> 00:00:04,046
but a false positive

4
00:00:04,046 --> 00:00:05,231
on a toxic mushroom

5
00:00:05,231 --> 00:00:06,578
can be fatal.

6
00:00:06,632 --> 00:00:08,023
The reason computer vision

7
00:00:08,023 --> 00:00:08,860
fails so badly

8
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,045
is a physical trap

9
00:00:10,045 --> 00:00:11,633
called visual occlusion.

10
00:00:11,688 --> 00:00:12,900
Take the death cap,

11
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,189
a highly toxic mushroom

12
00:00:14,189 --> 00:00:15,371
AI frequently mistakes

13
00:00:15,371 --> 00:00:17,169
for a harmless edible.

14
00:00:17,223 --> 00:00:18,163
AI relies strictly

15
00:00:18,163 --> 00:00:19,613
on surface pixels.

16
00:00:19,668 --> 00:00:20,504
From a top-down

17
00:00:20,504 --> 00:00:21,470
smartphone photo,

18
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:22,448
the death cap's shape

19
00:00:22,448 --> 00:00:24,176
looks perfectly innocent.

20
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,170
But human experts

21
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:27,147
don't just look at the cap.

22
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:27,934
To spot this

23
00:00:27,934 --> 00:00:28,865
specific threat,

24
00:00:28,865 --> 00:00:29,843
they check for a

25
00:00:29,843 --> 00:00:30,609
sack-like structure

26
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:32,586
at the base of the stem.

27
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,097
But out in the wild,

28
00:00:34,097 --> 00:00:34,934
this crucial root

29
00:00:34,934 --> 00:00:36,013
is completely buried

30
00:00:36,013 --> 00:00:38,055
under soil and fallen leaves.

31
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:38,946
Because it's blocked

32
00:00:38,946 --> 00:00:40,855
from the camera's line of sight

33
00:00:40,855 --> 00:00:42,169
that's visual occlusion

34
00:00:42,169 --> 00:00:43,864
the data doesn't exist.

35
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:44,997
And this limitation

36
00:00:44,997 --> 00:00:46,832
goes deeper than the dirt.

37
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:48,106
Splitting the stem open

38
00:00:48,106 --> 00:00:49,526
reveals hidden dark stains,

39
00:00:49,526 --> 00:00:50,812
a chemical indicator

40
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:51,914
of poison.

41
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:53,256
A 2D surface image

42
00:00:53,256 --> 00:00:54,196
can never capture

43
00:00:54,196 --> 00:00:55,750
that internal texture.

44
00:00:55,804 --> 00:00:56,989
Because AI can't infer

45
00:00:56,989 --> 00:00:58,408
features it can't see,

46
00:00:58,408 --> 00:00:59,835
it makes life-or-death guesses

47
00:00:59,835 --> 00:01:01,666
using deceptive camouflage.

48
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:03,281
And that deadly death cap,

49
00:01:03,281 --> 00:01:04,362
missing the buried root

50
00:01:04,362 --> 00:01:05,434
and toxic stains,

51
00:01:05,434 --> 00:01:06,861
the AI confidently labels

52
00:01:06,861 --> 00:01:08,107
the lethal hazard:

53
00:01:08,107 --> 00:01:11,000
safe to eat.

